      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that feels a bit heavy on the buzzwords though, almost a little too much. i'm worried the editor might think it's just being pedantic rather than actually helpful. \n\ntry to smooth it out. can you rewrite it to be more focused on the actual technical execution? basically, i need you to unpack *why* those methodology gaps matter for the results, but try to keep the critique grounded in the science so it doesn't just look like a list of negative words. keep it professional and nuanced.",
